      "mergeID": "5b60f8505deb5f626c7b1b99",
      "mergedPostDetails": "There is lots of thought being put into how to get more people to hang out in VRC and see that it is an active community.\n\nAdvertising the events on the loading screens would be a great way to put this information in front of users.\n\n/ Credit to TCL",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Show Notices for Events on the Loading Screens",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
