      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A better option would be adding a new tab for events. Right now we have social, worlds, avatars, but we don't have any events yet, which could be a great addition to VRChat, without a doubt.",
